# BROWSER-restack.md - Substack Restack Patterns

## SS 10. Restack with a Note

🚨 **Radix UI dropdown:** Substack uses Radix UI for the Restack menu. MUST use `PointerEvent` sequence (`pointerdown` → `pointerup` → `click`).

🚨 **Restack button has TWO shapes depending on page type — selector tries both:**
- **Articles** (`/p/...` on a publication domain): `button.post-ufi-button` with no aria-label AND no innerText AND class includes `no-label`. Sits in the post UFI toolbar (Like / Comment / **Restack** / Share / More). The UFI bar contains 2 no-label buttons (Restack + Save/More) — the JS below tries each candidate and verifies the opened menu has "Restack with a note".
- **Notes** (`/note/...` URLs, Notes feed, profile pages): `button[aria-label="Restack"]`. Button text is the restack count (e.g. "7"), NOT the word "Restack".

🚨 **Pre-clear with Escape before clicking.** Radix dropdowns toggle: if a stale menu is already open (from a prior tab/state), the click closes it and you get "menu not opened". Always dispatch `keydown Escape` first.

### Step 1 — Click Restack button and select "Restack with a note"

```bash
exec curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3847/api/browser/{{browser_profile}}/evaluate -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d @- <<'ENDJSON'
{"fn":"async () => { document.dispatchEvent(new KeyboardEvent('keydown', { key: 'Escape', bubbles: true })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 500)); var candidates = []; var likeBtns = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button')).filter(function(b) { return (b.getAttribute('aria-label') || '').startsWith('Like ('); }); if (likeBtns.length > 0) { var articleLike = likeBtns[likeBtns.length - 1]; var container = articleLike.parentElement.parentElement; var allBtns = Array.from(container.querySelectorAll('button')); if (allBtns[2]) candidates.push(allBtns[2]); } var notesBtns = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button[aria-label=\"Restack\"]')); for (var n = 0; n < notesBtns.length; n++) { if (candidates.indexOf(notesBtns[n]) === -1) candidates.push(notesBtns[n]); } var articleBtns = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button[class*=\"post-ufi-button\"]')).filter(function(b) { var t = (b.innerText || '').trim(); var a = b.getAttribute('aria-label') || ''; return !a && !t && b.className.toString().includes('no-label') && b.getBoundingClientRect().width > 0; }); for (var a2 = 0; a2 < articleBtns.length; a2++) { if (candidates.indexOf(articleBtns[a2]) === -1) candidates.push(articleBtns[a2]); } if (candidates.length === 0) return { error: 'no restack button candidates found' }; for (var i = 0; i < candidates.length; i++) { var btn = candidates[i]; var rect = btn.getBoundingClientRect(); var cx = rect.x + rect.width / 2, cy = rect.y + rect.height / 2; btn.dispatchEvent(new PointerEvent('pointerdown', { bubbles: true, clientX: cx, clientY: cy })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 50)); btn.dispatchEvent(new PointerEvent('pointerup', { bubbles: true, clientX: cx, clientY: cy })); btn.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click', { bubbles: true, clientX: cx, clientY: cy })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 1500)); var menuItems = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[role=\"menuitem\"]')); var quoteItem = menuItems.find(function(m) { return m.innerText.trim() === 'Restack with a note'; }); if (quoteItem) { quoteItem.click(); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 2000)); var editor = document.querySelector('div[contenteditable=\"true\"]'); return { opened: !!editor, candidateIdx: i }; } document.dispatchEvent(new KeyboardEvent('keydown', { key: 'Escape', bubbles: true })); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 300)); } return { error: 'no candidate opened the restack menu', candidatesTried: candidates.length }; }"}
ENDJSON
```

### Step 2 — Type quote note and post

Use **BROWSER-note.md SS 9 Step 2** (identical Notes composer — contenteditable + "Post" button).

### When to Restack

Restack content aligned with your pillars with genuine {{role}} perspective. Skip off-topic, low-quality, self-restacks. Quote note: 1-3 sentences adding real value, not just "great post".
